msgid "Each country builds its own stack on the layers of the DPI-H reference architecture. Underneath both is WHO GDHCN: the shared trust list that lets an Onesan clinic believe a Taifafeki certificate, and a Taifafeki clinic believe an Onesan link, with no direct connection between the two."
